' ============================================================
'  ASSOCIAZIONI TRA PACKAGE
' ============================================================

' --- DAO Postgree → DatabaseConnection ---
ChefDAO_Postgree ..> DatabaseConnection
AllievoDAO_Postgree ..> DatabaseConnection
CorsoDAO_Postgree ..> DatabaseConnection
SessioneDAO_Postgree ..> DatabaseConnection
RicettaDAO_Postgree ..> DatabaseConnection
NotificaDAO_Postgree ..> DatabaseConnection
StatsDAO_Postgree ..> DatabaseConnection

' --- DAO Postgree → Model ---
ChefDAO_Postgree ..> Chef
AllievoDAO_Postgree ..> Allievo
CorsoDAO_Postgree ..> Corso
SessioneDAO_Postgree ..> Sessione
RicettaDAO_Postgree ..> Ricetta
NotificaDAO_Postgree ..> Notifica
StatsDAO_Postgree ..> ChefStatsDTO

' --- AppController → User e DAO ---
AppController "1" --> "0..1" User
AppController --> ChefDAO
AppController --> AllievoDAO
AppController --> CorsoDAO
AppController --> SessioneDAO
AppController --> RicettaDAO
AppController --> NotificaDAO
AppController --> StatsDAO

' --- AppController → Dialog ---
AppController ..> ErrorDialog
AppController ..> WarningDialog
AppController ..> TermsOfServiceDialog



' --- SplashGUI → TypeWritingController ---
SplashGUI -- TypeWritingController

' --- View → AppController ---
DashboardGUI -- AppController
LoginGUI -- AppController
SplashGUI -- AppController
CoursesViewGUI -- AppController
RecipesViewGUI -- AppController
NotificationsViewGUI -- AppController
ReportViewGUI -- AppController
CourseDetailsDialogGUI -- AppController
AddCourseDialogGUI -- AppController
AddRecipeDialogGUI -- AppController
AddNotificationDialogGUI -- AppController

' --- View → DTO ---
CoursesViewGUI ..> CourseDTO
RecipesViewGUI ..> RecipeDTO
NotificationsViewGUI ..> NotificationDTO
ReportViewGUI ..> ChefStatsDTO
CourseDetailsDialogGUI ..> SessionDTO
AddCourseDialogGUI ..> CourseWithSessionsDTO
AddCourseDialogGUI ..> RecipeDTO
AddRecipeDialogGUI ..> RecipeDTO
AddNotificationDialogGUI ..> NotificationDTO
AddNotificationDialogGUI ..> CourseDTO


legend top left
  *-- : composizione UML
  +.. : relazione con simbolo + (solo PlantUML)
  --> : associazione
endlegend

